snek - snake.io / slither.io clone

This project includes algorithms adapted from the following open-source
projects. No source code is copied verbatim; the implementations here
are rewrites in TypeScript that follow the original algorithms.

- knagaitsev/slither.io-clone (MIT)
  - Segment-chain kinematics:       src/snake/snake.ts
  - Mouse-angle steering math:      src/input/pointer.ts

- jondubois/iogrid (MIT)
  - Spatial hash grid:              shared/spatialHash.ts

- owenashurst/agar.io-clone (MIT)
  - Food balance loop:              src/food/foodSpawner.ts
